	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Salve per Christum a deo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Iucundas et gratas literas a te, doctissime et in Christo charissime <lb xml:id="p1z2"/><persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, nobis Iacobus frater noster attulit, quibus charitatem et indefessam tuam sollicitudinem <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>erga nos et ecclesiam nostrę dispensationi comissam perspicimus.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Cum enim iudicio tuo acri sanoque <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>consilio egimus, sedulum et ad omnesque horas te promptum [!] experti sumusque ita persuasi in quocunque <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>honesto prioque negocio te nobis a consiliis fore semper agimusque gratias tibi quam possumus maximas, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>quod nostram ecclesiam fidei nostrę comissam prudentissimis et circumspectis consiliis usque huc <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>tibi ex intimo corde commendatam habuisti.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/>Nunc hęc, quę ministris verbi in urbe a senatu nostro proposita sunt diebus aliquot praeterlapsis, <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>tibi communicaretur, fratribus nostris placuit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Hęc sunt, quae a grammateo sedente senatu <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>nobis praelecta de verbo ad verbum acta sunt 29. Octobris.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z11"/>Mine gnädigen herren burgermeyster, klein und groͤsse raͤtt habend erkent <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>uff unserer getruwen lieben eydgnossen von den <placeName ref="l2542">7 Orten</placeName> gesanten furbringen, <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>as die predicanten sond beschickt werden für den kleinenn radt, und sol inen <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>gesagt werden, das si nun furhin das goͤtlich wort nuws und alts testaments <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>sond predigen, sich selbs und gmeine stat bedenckend, niemants schmutzind <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>und schmähind und niemant namsind, damit nit ergers daruß erwachse, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>dessy sich min herren zuͦ inen versehen geschehen werden.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z18"/>Super ista que respondenda sint praeterita proxima synodo consultatum est a fratribus; <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>ni temporis brevitas me abduxisset, hic adscripsissem.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">At facile quivis, ad tam perplexa <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>et quamvis multa in se continentia verba quidnam respondendum sit, elicere potest.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z21"/>At, <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName> omnium dilectissime, paucis, ut potes, verbis tuam in hęc nobis proposita sententiam <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>avide cupimus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z23"/>De futuro consilio nulla facta est coram ministris mencio.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z24"/>De vestro in concilium consensu et sententiam omnium vestram, quam referetis ad deputatos, <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>fidei nostrę communicato, efflagitamus.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Dominus conservet vos omnes verbi ministros ecclesię <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>suę perpetuo incolumes, quos omnes nostro omnium nomine plurimum saluta.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p1z27"/>Vale.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Raptim <placeName ref="l441">Schaffhusię</placeName> 7. Novembris anno 1548.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z28"/><persName ref="p8090">Heinricus Lęvinus</persName>, tuus deditissimus.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutant te qua<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>m officiosissime <persName ref="p3481">Sim<lb xml:id="p1z30"/>pertus</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z31"/><persName ref="p2916">Sebastianus</persName>, <persName>Iacobu<lb xml:id="p1z32"/>s</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Evangelicę doctrinę clarissimo <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>viro M. <persName ref="p495">H. Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurinę</placeName> ecclesię pastori <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>vigilantissimo, ad manus.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
